{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>As a police officer your duty is to uncover the truth behind the disapareances and to put an end to this nightmare ! Port Charles folks are counting on you !</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>No HUD. No waypoints. No hand-holding. Find your way. Trust nothing. Make no sound.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent Hunt embraces a retro minimalist design philosophy. There are no objective markers to follow, no UI cluttering your screen. You navigate Mist Island the way a real officer would, by reading the environment,  and trusting your instincts. Every shadow, every sound, every trail of blood tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a massive island created on one of the best rendering engine.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607330/extras/GIF4X4.gif?t=1773597346\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By foot or using your trusty truck, comb every nook and cranny of the island until you find the reason for missing people. But beware because danger wait for you at every corner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<br><strong>Investigate clues of missing people.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607330/extras/GasolineGIF.gif?t=1773597346\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues of missing people and uncover the origins of the threat on the island, unlock your path in the island whether finding keys, codes or even shooting your way trough !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the danger that lurks in Mist Island.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607330/extras/SurvivalGIF.gif?t=1773597346\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage carefully your ammo, health, batteries, car's fuel and even your smell to avoid detection and survive another day ! Death is a quick sentence on Mist Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect and get helped by the local population.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607330/extras/billy_gif_retouch\u00e9.gif?t=1773597346\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duty is to protect and serve... and maybe get helped by the local population of Mist Island if you're the one in trouble. But first you need to win their trust !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight and wipe out the threat of vicious dinosaurs.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607330/extras/FightGIF.gif?t=1773597346\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way trough missions and bring the firepower necessary to finally wipe out of the island these cold, pack hunting, prehistoric killers ! You can't take a rest officer !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Synopsis </u>:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Port Charles, British Columbia has been plagued by disapereances in the last months. You are sent with your colleague, Lt. Murdoch, to investigate missing people and bring back trust in this isolated community. Explore the island, investigate the clue, find the killer and neutralise him !\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>This game is made by a solo developer, if you want to support development please wishlist the game to help us reach more audience. A discord server will be online soon for further development updates.</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607330/extras/0abe0bddaccfdf946bca79f773db7145.poster.avif?t=1773597346\" width=472 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607330/extras/0abe0bddaccfdf946bca79f773db7145.webm?t=1773597346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607330/extras/0abe0bddaccfdf946bca79f773db7145.mp4?t=1773597346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607330?t=1773597346","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607330/13b8c18bcad1381fbf3bbb8a8fb7d97819700547/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773597346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607330/0e3b759329a231389fdb7ae856612d3b5d02effc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773597346","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607330/0e3b759329a231389fdb7ae856612d3b5d02effc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773597346","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Intense Scifi terror with death and violence from dinosaurs against humans and against other dinosaurs. Infrequent swearing in the dialogue. There are intelligent... very intelligent"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >